notes.body:
Just added support for installing the new library/DLL.  I was able to test on Windows, but don't have other platforms, yet pipeline was happily passing before I added installation support.
This worries me from the standpoint of accidentally breaking the running of Wireshark if this is put in master.
@rbalint - I know I don't have Debian package updated here.  Should that be a requirement of this MR or can it be handled separately? (Again, it looks like accepting this would result in the immediate breakage of using Wireshark on Debian)

